# FLOQR service receipts (always)

Every paid or fulfilled FLOQR service (ShoutOut, VIP reserV, FloqCast, guest list, ads, etc.) uses **one receipt contract**. Prefer the VIP reserV descriptive style over thin labels like “FLOQR paid ShoutOut”.

## Required datapoints (every receipt)

| Field | Examples |
|---|---|
| Identity | `invoiceNumber` / `referenceNumber` (`FLOQR-YYYYMMDD-…`), `orderId`, `orderType` |
| Title | Human service line, not a product-only stub — e.g. `Table C10 deposit — Decades, 2026-10-16` or `Football Intro @ Aurelia — Fri 10pm LED` |
| Venue | `venueName` / `locationName`, `clubLocationId`, address when known |
| When | `serviceDate` / `night`, `serviceTime` / event time, `paidAtIso` / `createdAt` |
| Commerce | `amountCents`, `currency`, `paymentStatus`, `fulfillmentStatus` |
| Card (if card pay) | `cardBrand`, **`cardLast4`** only (never full PAN / CVV) |
| Services rendered | `itemName`, line items / `servicesRendered[]`, template / section / screen when relevant |
| Provenance (when lawful) | `clientIp` (request IP), `clientGeo` / approximate GPS **only with explicit patron consent** or venue ops need; never sell; redact in public logs |

## Routing

| Outcome | FloqR Inbox | Email (SendGrid) | Feature & Orders |
|---|---|---|---|
| **Saved** draft (unsubmitted ShoutOut) | No | No | My ShoutOuts → Saved |
| **Pending** (submitted / awaiting club / unpaid hold) | No | No | Status + My ShoutOuts → Pending |
| **Completed / paid confirmed** | Yes (`inboxNotifications`) | Yes when SendGrid healthy | Status + My Invoices / Paid history |

VIP reserV paid deposits are **completed** commerce → Inbox + invoice row (same as paid ShoutOut final receipt).

## Writers

- Build via shared receipt helpers (`functions/receipt-delivery.js` or successor). Do not invent one-off titles per product.
- Paid checkout fulfill paths must call the shared deliverer (Inbox + optional email), not only mutate `serviceOrders`.
- Portal **Feature & Orders** lists use the same title fields patrons see on the receipt.

## Checklist before ship

- [ ] Title reads like VIP reserV (service + venue + when), not a bare brand stub
- [ ] `cardLast4` stored when Stripe payment_method is card
- [ ] Completed → Inbox; Pending/Saved → not Inbox
- [ ] IP/geo only with consent policy respected
- [ ] i18n chrome for new Feature & Orders labels in all supported langs
